VarDeclaration.description:
One `{{vars.*}}` variable this agent reads, and what it falls back to.

The request that starts the session supplies values that override `default`;
an inbound phone call or message has none, so `default` is what resolves.

patch.description:
Edit a batch. Pacing and the window reach a live send within minutes.

`variable_map` changes only before sending, `start_at` only before it begins;
a finished batch takes `name` alone.
